        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gaba Esawu gweanyeew haradam ghaghi Yudisi was hudeaba Beri bea eemeeda Hiti, ea Basemati was hudeaba Eloni bea eemeeda Hiti; ",
          "type": "text",
